The glacial river was destroyed on land and at the bottom of the sea.
Glacies defeated the Snow Lady. I used that chance and locked the Snow Lady in the Magic Prison so that Diana could enter her mind, calm her and learn her story.
Long ago, the Snowstorm Dragon accidentally created the glacial river, which ran through Gallubia Valley. The local tribes fled, but one family did not escape.
Only a newborn survived, suffering a mutation.
She was abandoned by her tribe and lived alone.

Very sad. Deliver this report to Commander Derik.

